OL,4,BTarkowski's first Premier League red   
OL,5,Bruins Moyes' night - was it deserved?  
OL,6,GIt had been some run for Everton       
OL,7,Gcaptain James Tarkowski.               
OL,9,FPrior to Monday night, the defender    
OL,10,Fhad received 74 yellow cards in the    
OL,11,FPremier League but had never been sent 
OL,12,Foff - a top-flight record.             
OL,14,FBut that run came to an end at         
OL,15,FBrentford as he was given his first    
OL,16,Fred card in his 351st Premier League   
OL,17,Fappearance, although the decision has  
OL,18,Fattracted plenty of debate.            
